  "name": "Win - CDW Baseline - SC - Shared Devices - D - Shared PC Mode - v1.0",
  "description": "Shared PC mode for frontline and hot-desk Windows devices. One Entra user at a time, no guest account, OneDrive sync on. Profiles are deleted when free disk drops below 25% (until 50% is free) or after 30 days unused; maintenance runs at 02:00. Sign-in is required on wake. Fast first sign-in and web sign-in (Temporary Access Pass, passwordless) speed up first use. Assign to a device group of shared devices only.",
